---
/**
 * A section rule with a label.
 *
 * For splitting a long page without spending another heading level: it is an `h2`, so the
 * document outline still says where the sections are, but it reads as a rule rather than
 * as a title.
 */
---

<h2 class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-subtle)]">
  <slot />
</h2>
